; AI chase (state $14) of a computer enemy. wake_idle_enemies sets it when the enemy stands idle.
; measure_distance_to_bruce gives bruce_dist_y = |dy| (at most $30, bit 7 = Bruce is lower) and
; bruce_dist_x = |dx| (at most $30, bit 7 = Bruce is to the right).
;   - No floor: walk on along a ladder or vine, else fall.
;   - |dy| >= $10: Bruce lower: walk on in the facing direction; Bruce higher: face him and recover.
;   - Same level, not facing Bruce: |dx| >= $21 turn around and walk, else back off (state $15).
